{"3238290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rift Drift", "steam_appid": 3238290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rift Drift</i> is an infinite drifting game where you pilot customizable rockets through procedurally generated tracks and biomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around momentum, flow, and minimalism, it’s a game about mastering movement, chasing records, or simply enjoying the ride. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between infinite runs or focused time trials. Drift fast, drift smooth, and find your rhythm across a variety of level biomes with unique shapes and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238290/extras/460d24dcc023bf7443367eba08091f84.avif?t=1757036976\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum based drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No speed cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy of levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238290/extras/371c6a4704cf24a2e8543b9da993753d.avif?t=1757036976\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rift Drift</i> invites you to master the art of momentum-based drifting as you pilot customizable rockets through a universe of procedurally generated tracks. Whether you're chasing a zen-like flow or an adrenaline-fueled race, each run offers new challenges and infinite replayability. Drift, boost, and discover diverse landscapes, upgrade your craft, and set new records!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rift Drift</i> is an infinite drifting game where you pilot customizable rockets through procedurally generated tracks and biomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around momentum, flow, and minimalism, it’s a game about mastering movement, chasing records, or simply enjoying the ride. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between infinite runs or focused time trials. Drift fast, drift smooth, and find your rhythm across a variety of level biomes with unique shapes and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238290/extras/460d24dcc023bf7443367eba08091f84.avif?t=1757036976\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum based drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No speed cap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy of levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238290/extras/371c6a4704cf24a2e8543b9da993753d.avif?t=1757036976\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rift Drift</i> invites you to master the art of momentum-based drifting as you pilot customizable rockets through a universe of procedurally generated tracks. Whether you're chasing a zen-like flow or an adrenaline-fueled race, each run offers new challenges and infinite replayability. Drift, boost, and discover diverse landscapes, upgrade your craft, and set new records!</p>", "short_description": "Momentum based Rocket Drifting. Drift, Boost, Customize, and Compete across a variety of Biomes in Infinite Mode and dozens of levels.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st